        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c210c72b-a03b-40ce-a370-da5b895e8351).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47\r\rYour target is Juan Domingo Siciliano also known as &quot;The Ambassador&quot;, he works as a middle man for many people who wish to perform illegal deals, and that includes whoever hired Alexander back in Bangkok as we&#39;ve found out that he was the one who commissioned the spyware.\r\rIntel says he was spotted crossing the border between argentina and uruguay about a week ago and is currently at vi&#241;edo Yates to strike up a big deal with one of the CEOs attending the party. The magnitude of this deal warranted for Augusto Albarez, Domingo&#39;s right hand man, to accompany Domingo at the deal\r\rGood luck 47, I&#39;ll leave you to prepare.\r",
